rts":[{"text":"குறுமை","lemma":"குறுமை","gloss":"short"},{"text":"கை","lemma":"கை","gloss":"paw"}],"gloss":"short-pawed"},{"surface":"இரும்புலி","parts":[{"text":"இரும்புலி","lemma":"இரும்புலி","gloss":"large tiger"}],"gloss":"large tiger"},{"surface":"கொலைவல்","parts":[{"text":"கொலை","lemma":"கொலை","gloss":"killing"},{"text":"வல்","lemma":"வல்","gloss":"expert"}],"gloss":"expert in killing"},{"surface":"ஏற்றை","parts":[{"text":"ஏற்றை","lemma":"ஏற்றை","gloss":"male animal"}],"gloss":"male"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பைங்கண்","parts":[{"text":"பைங்கண்","lemma":"பைங்கண்","gloss":"green-eyed"}],"gloss":"green-eyed","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"செந்நாய்","parts":[{"text":"செந்நாய்","lemma":"செந்நாய்","gloss":"red wild dog"}],"gloss":"red wild dog","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"படுபதம்","parts":[{"text":"படு","lemma":"படு","gloss":"fall/perish"},{"text":"பதம்","lemma":"பதம்","gloss":"prey/meat"}],"gloss":"fallen prey"},{"surface":"பார்க்கும்","parts":[{"text":"பார்","lemma":"பார்","gloss":"watch"},{"text":"க்","lemma":"க்","gloss":"future marker"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"adjectival suffix"}],"gloss":"watching for"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆரிரு","parts":[{"text":"ஆரிரு","lemma":"ஆரிரு","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ணடுநாள்","parts":[{"text":"ணடுநாள்","lemma":"ணடுநாள்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வருதி","parts":[{"text":"வருதி","lemma":"வருதி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"சாரல்","parts":[{"text":"சாரல்","lemma":"சாரல்","gloss":"mountain slope"}],"gloss":"mountain slope"},{"surface":"நாட","parts":[{"text":"நாடு","lemma":"நாடு","gloss":"land"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"vocative suffix"}],"gloss":"O lord of the land!"},{"surface":"வாரலோ","parts":[{"text":"வாரல்","lemma":"வாரல்","gloss":"do not come"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"do not come"},{"surface":"எனவே","parts":[{"text":"என","lemma":"என","gloss":"thus"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"thus indeed"}]}],"literal":"Curved-beaked small parrots ripening millet to drive away / \"Go,\" she said, mother, \"thus you\" / if you say, what [will happen], friend? In the field, / long-trunked strong animal's fierce enmity endured, / short-pawed large tiger, expert in killing, male, / green-eyed red wild dog watching for its fallen prey, / in the deep darkness of midnight you come, / O lord of the mountain slopes! \"Do not come,\" thus [say].","translation":"O friend! What would happen if you tell him: \"Mother has told me to go and drive away the curved-beaked small parrots from the ripening millet field. So, O lord of the mountain slopes, do not come at midnight in the deep darkness, when the green-eyed red wild dogs watch for the fallen prey of the short-pawed male tiger, expert in killing, which has endured the fierce enmity of the long-trunked strong elephant\"?","modern":"தோழியே! 'வளைந்த மூக்கையுடைய சிறிய கிளிகளை விளைந்த தினைப்புனத்திலிருந்து விரட்டுவதற்காகப் போ என்று அன்னை என்னிடம் கூறினாள்; அதனால், நீண்ட துதிக்கையையுடைய வலிமையான யானையோடு கடுமையான பகை கொண்டு போரிட்ட, குட்டையான கைகளையுடைய, கொலை செய்வதில் வல்ல ஆண் புலியின் வீழ்த்தப்பட்ட இரையை எதிர்பார்த்துப் பசுமையான கண்களையுடைய செந்நாய்கள் காத்திருக்கும் அரிய இருள் நிறைந்த நள்ளிரவில், மலைநாடனே! நீ வரவேண்டாம்' என்று நீ அவனிடம் சொன்னால் என்ன?","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her friend while the hero is listening nearby in secret. She suggests that her friend should tell the hero that her mother has sent her to guard the millet fields during the day. This implies that they can now meet safely in the daytime, and he no longer needs to make the perilous journey at night. The vivid description of the night path—where green-eyed wild dogs wait to scavenge the prey of a fierce male tiger that has just fought a strong elephant—emphasizes the extreme danger of his nightly visits. By describing these dangers of the mountain slopes (Kuṟiñci landscape), she indirectly urges him to stop his secret night visits and seek a formal, public marriage.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.1],[1.1,1.58],[1.58,2.0],[2.0,2.59],[2.59,2.7],[2.7,3.0],[3.0,3.14],[3.5,4.5],[4.5,4.9],[4.9,5.2],[5.2,5.7],[5.7,6.6],[6.6,6.7],[6.7,7.18],[7.18,7.9],[7.9,8.9],[8.9,9.2],[9.2,9.7],[9.7,9.9],[9.9,10.15],[10.15,10.9],[10.9,11.33],[11.33,12.4],[12.4,13.18],[13.3,13.6],[13.6,13.9],[13.9,15.26],[15.26,15.26],[15.26,15.6],[15.6,15.9]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.2],[1.2,1.84],[1.84,2.3],[2.3,3.09],[3.09,3.2],[3.2,3.5],[3.5,4.2],[4.2,5.3],[5.3,5.5],[5.5,5.8],[5.8,6.4],[6.4,7.24],[7.24,7.24],[7.24,7.24],[7.24,8.5],[8.5,9.5],[9.5,10.1],[10.1,10.3],[10.3,10.5],[10.5,12.0],[12.0,12.1],[12.1,13.1],[13.1,13.7],[13.7,14.42],[14.5,14.8],[14.8,15.1],[15.1,16.2],[16.2,16.6],[16.6,16.6],[16.6,17.5]]},"sync":[[["வளைவாய்","curved beak"]],[["சிறு","small"],["கிளி","parrot"]],[["விளை","ripened"],["தினை","millet"],["கடீஇயர்","to drive away"]],[["கடீஇயர்","to drive away"]],[["செல்க","may you go"],["என்றோளே","she who said indeed"]],[["என்றோளே","she who said indeed"]],[["அன்னை","mother"]],[["என","saying"],["நீ","you"]],[["சொல்லின்","if you say"]],[["எவனோ","what will happen?"]],[["தோழி","O friend"]],[["கொல்லை","field"]],[["நெடுங்கை","long-trunked"]],[["வன்மான்","strong animal (elephant)"]],[["கடும்பகை","fierce enmity"]],[["உழந்த","that endured"]],[["குறுங்கை","short-pawed"]],[["இரும்புலி","large tiger"]],[["கொலைவல்","expert in killing"]],[["ஏற்றை","male"]],[["பைங்கண்","green-eyed"]],[["செந்நாய்","red wild dog"]],[["படுபதம்","fallen prey"]],[["பார்க்கும்","watching for"]],[["ஆரிரு",""]],[["ணடுநாள்",""]],[["வருதி",""]],[["சாரல்","mountain slope"]],[["நாட","O lord of the land!"]],[["வாரலோ","do not come"]],[["எனவே","thus indeed"]]]}